322">har</span><span begin="7.322" end="7.581">mo</span><span begin="7.581" end="7.666">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">鸟类和人类在看似完美的和谐中共存着</span></p><p begin="7.905" end="11.054" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="7.905" end="8.144">Un</span><span begin="8.144" end="8.365">til</span> <span begin="8.365" end="8.687">one</span> <span begin="8.687" end="9.069">day</span> <span begin="9.069" end="9.221">a</span> <span begin="9.221" end="9.433">young</span> <span begin="9.433" end="9.801">man</span> <span begin="9.801" end="9.996">catch</span><span begin="9.996" end="10.198">es</span> <span begin="10.198" end="11.054">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到一天 一个年轻的人类引火上身</span></p><p begin="11.385" end="12.621" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="11.385" end="11.766">This</span> <span begin="11.766" end="12.113">is</span> <span begin="12.113" end="12.621">&quot;Phoenix&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这就是“不死鸟”</span></p><p begin="18.558" end="23.187" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.558" end="18.932">You</span> <span begin="20.221" end="20.580">You&apos;ve</span> <span begin="20.580" end="20.963">been</span> <span begin="20.963" end="21.308">knocked</span> <span begin="21.308" end="21.699">down</span> <span begin="21.699" end="21.869">and</span> <span begin="21.869" end="22.262">got</span> <span begin="22.262" end="22.653">up</span> <span begin="22.653" end="23.187">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你不断被击倒 又一次次地站起来</span></p><p begin="23.900" end="28.120" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.900" end="24.081">In</span> <span begin="24.081" end="24.248">the</span> <span begin="24.248" end="24.597">cor</span><span begin="24.597" end="25.025">ner</span> <span begin="25.025" end="25.381">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="25.381" end="25.692">sur</span><span begin="25.692" end="26.028">round</span><span begin="26.028" end="26.448">ed</span>